    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nA superb opportunity to acquire a substantial four-bedroom detached family home, ideally positioned in a quiet and highly sought-after cul-de-sac comprising just six residences.\n\nSituated within a short and pleasant walk of Ballina town centre, the property enjoys an enviable location along the banks of the River Moy and directly opposite Tom Ruane Park, making it particularly appealing to families and those seeking convenient access to the town and local amenities.\n\nPresented in excellent condition throughout, the property offers spacious and well-proportioned accommodation with three large upstairs bedrooms, two ensuite, while a further bedroom with ensuite is conveniently located on the ground floor. Full accommodation comprises an entrance hall, living/dining room, kitchen, lounge, utility room and downstairs bedroom, with three further bedrooms and the main bathroom located on the first floor.\n\nThe property has been maintained to a high standard, featuring quality flooring, tiling and tasteful décor throughout. Bright, spacious and exceptionally well presented, this is a wonderful family home offering generous living accommodation in a superb residential setting.\n\nExternally, the property benefits from a cobblelock driveway to the front, a front lawn with mature shrubbery and an additional cobblelock-paved area to the rear, providing excellent outdoor space and low-maintenance surroundings. A detached garden shed measuring 3.27m x 2.43m located to the rear.\n\nAn impressive home in a prime Ballina location, this property is sure to appeal to a wide range of discerning purchasers and early viewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Porch - 1.49m x 3.1m\nTiled floor.\n\nHallway - 3.12m x 3.13m\nOak timber floor.Understairs storage.Coving.\n\nLiving/Dining Room - 3.87m x 7.91m\nCoving.Ornate fireplace.Double doors leading to patio and paved area.\n\nKitchen - 3.6m x 3.91m\nFitted kitchen.Granite worktops.Tiled floor.\n\nUtility Room - 2.12m x 2.93m\nFitted units.Tiled floor.\n\nLounge Area - 3.17m x 3.86m\nWood floor.Patio door leading to paved outdoor area.\n\nBedroom Ground Floor - 2.92m x 4.38m\nBuilt in Wardrobes.Ensuite.Wood floor.\n\nEn Suite - \nTiled,.Mira electric shower.\n\nLanding - 1.15m x 4.38m\n\n\nMaster Bedroom - 3.47m x 4.22m\nDressing room.Ensuite.Built in wardrobes.\n\nEn Suite - 1.83m x 2.57m\nFully tiled.Electric shower.\n\nDressing room - 2.42m x 2.55m\n\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.72m x 3.91m\nBuilt in Wardrobes.Ensuite.\n\nEn Suite - 1.83m x 2.51m\nElectric pumped shower,.Fully tiled.\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.87m x 4.08m\n\n\nBathroom - 1.89m x 2.73m\nPartially tiled.Bath.\n\n"
